# tests/gates/controls/OMEGA-GATE-CLAIMS.controls: controls the OMEGA-GATE-CLAIMS step must report as
# "CONTROL OMEGA-GATE-CLAIMS/<name> FAILED_AS_REQUIRED" (tools/gate_claims_lint.sh); tests/gates/run.sh step_verdict fails the step
# when one is missing, and tools/gate_claims_lint.sh accepts [ctl:OMEGA-GATE-CLAIMS/<name>] for a name listed here.
uncited-claim
unknown-gate
unlisted-control
shell-comment-paragraph
c-block-comment
baseline-edited
tools-changed-file
last-paragraph-path
unwrapped-gate-controls
log-citation
no-base-not-run
